Package: ponscripter
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends} ${misc:Depends}
Description: NScripter-like novel-game interpreter with Unicode support
Shiori is an interpreter for visual-novel-type games, derived
 from ONScripter but modified significantly to improve support for
 Western languages (at the cost of diminished support for Japanese).
